---
/**
 * CommonHead.astro — minimal head element with charset + viewport.
 *
 * Self-contained replacement for `@saastro-io/shell/head/CommonHead.astro`.
 * Drops the sitemap link (docs sites typically don't ship one) and the
 * marketing-oriented dns-prefetch hints.
 */
---
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
